      "created_at": "2013-04-21T03:46:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Once a Boost is used, it is placed in the discard pile, and the opopsition will not get to use it multiple time. This means that the Strike Force players completely lost the ability to buy that card.</p><p>The \"streetlights\" don't add any info (well not that I know of).</p>",
